// Outdoor terrain, drawn by tools/Nosum.MapGen (sheets; docs/adr/ADR-042 P2).
// Fills: index kind × 4 + variant. Kinds: 0 grass, 1 dirt, 2 sand, 3 path, 4 cliff, 5 shallow water, 6 deep water.
// Transitions 28 to 125: seven pairs of 14, tile 28 + 14 × pair + (code − 1), with no traits: the fills under them carry the traits.
// Pairs: 0 grass over dirt, 1 grass over sand, 2 sand over shallow water, 3 grass over shallow water, 4 shallow over deep water,
// 5 grass over cliff, 6 grass over path.
name terrain
image terrain.png
tilewidth 16
tileheight 16
columns 16
tilecount 126
tile 4-7 Diggable
tile 12-15 Passable
tile 16-19 Impassable
tile 20-23 Water
tile 24-27 Water Impassable
